    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gyftqzs",
      "content": "Chhattisgarh is one of the fastest growing states in India. The economy is primarily based on agriculture, mineral resources, and forest produce. The state is rich in natural resources including coal, iron ore, limestone, tin, gold, bauxite, and dolomite. The state ranks among the top producers of several minerals in India."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6hsrooc",
      "content": "Despite its rich natural resources, Chhattisgarh faces challenges of poverty, illiteracy, and Naxalism in some regions. The government has been implementing various schemes to improve infrastructure, attract investment, and boost economic growth."
    },
    {
