    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "l3i7zcc",
      "content": "The state government launched the 'Rajiv Gandhi Kisan Nyay Yojana' to provide income support to farmers. The scheme provides direct benefit transfer (DBT) to farmers for cultivation of paddy, sugarcane, maize, and other crops."
    },
    {
      "id": "gfuekdz",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4.4 Industries"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qh4pcvg",
      "content": "Chhattisgarh has emerged as a major industrial hub, especially in the steel, cement, power, and aluminum sectors. Bhilai Steel Plant (BSP), set up with Soviet assistance in 1959, is one of the largest integrated steel plants in Asia."
    },
