      "content": "4.5 Minerals"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tf9m8tg",
      "content": "Chhattisgarh is extremely rich in mineral resources. The state contributes significantly to India's mineral production. It is the only state in India that produces tin ore. The Bailadila iron ore mines in Dantewada are among the highest quality iron ore deposits in the world, with iron content of over 68%."
    },
